# Build context for deploy/witness/Dockerfile (context: the repository
# root). The image needs the Rust sources only; keep build output, git
# history, local journals, keys and agent working directories out of the
# context sent to the daemon.
.git
.github
.claude
**/target
target-*
**/node_modules
**/.venv*
**/__pycache__
web/pkg
web/pkg-go
*.jsonl
*.wlog
*.salts
*.payloads
*.witnesses.json
*.key
*.pem
*.seed
.env
.env.*
fuzz/corpus
fuzz/artifacts
examples/swarm/reports
